XSlim 2.1.2+riscy.2

Unofficial RISCY-SVT build based on spacemit-com/xslim commit
9a33f2f770d00fd02ff8bc0f1907135e9bf47f8c.

This build is not endorsed by SpacemiT. The upstream-authored two-input
ReduceMax repair remains attributed to upstream. RISCY-SVT additions are
listed in MODIFICATIONS.md.

